                <p>Not printed. The proposed agreement on the revision of the Italian armistice
                    terms, as finally approved by the Council of Foreign Ministers on May 16, was
                    circulated as document C.F.M. (46) 95, May 16,
                    1946, <ref target="#pg436">p. 436</ref>. Differences between C.F.M. (46) 84 and C.F.M. (46) 95 are indicated in footnotes to the latter
                    document.</p>
            </note>
